  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> be defined as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. Then the domain of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>fog</mi></math> is :",
