  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Case-I: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mtext>Rejected as</mtext><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Case-I: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>→</mo><mtext>Not possible</mtext></math></p><p>So, domain of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>domain of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>Domain of</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>fog</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
